{%- comment -%} Men's Perfumes editorial content (renders below the product grid on collection.mens) {%- endcomment -%}

<!-- FIND THE RIGHT SCENT FOR THE MOMENT -->
<section class="section family-section"><div class="container">
  <div class="sec-head center">
    <span class="label">Find Your Match</span>
    <h2 class="sec-title">Find the Right Scent <em>for the Moment</em></h2>
    <p class="sec-sub">A great men's fragrance is the one that fits the occasion. Match the scent to where you are headed, and the choice gets a lot simpler.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="usp-grid four">
    <a class="usp-card fam-card fade-up" href="/collections/fresh-citrus">
      <div class="fam-num">01</div>
      <h3>Fresh &amp; Citrus</h3>
      <p>Your daytime workhorse. Bright citrus, crisp herbs and clean woods stay sharp in the heat and keep close to the skin, so they read as polished at the office rather than overpowering in a meeting room.</p>
      <div class="fam-bestfor"><span class="bl">Best For</span><div class="fam-tags"><span>The Office</span><span>Daytime</span><span>Hot Weather</span></div></div>
      <span class="fam-link">Explore Fresh &amp; Citrus <span class="mi" aria-hidden="true">arrow_forward</span></span>
    </a>
    <a class="usp-card fam-card fade-up" href="/collections/spicy-oriental">
      <div class="fam-num">02</div>
      <h3>Spicy &amp; Oriental</h3>
      <p>Built for the evening. Pepper, cardamom, amber and incense give a fragrance real projection and warmth, the kind of scent that fills a room and lingers long after you have left it.</p>
      <div class="fam-bestfor"><span class="bl">Best For</span><div class="fam-tags"><span>Evenings</span><span>Occasions</span><span>Winter Nights</span></div></div>
      <span class="fam-link">Explore Spicy &amp; Oriental <span class="mi" aria-hidden="true">arrow_forward</span></span>
    </a>
    <a class="usp-card fam-card fade-up" href="/collections/oud-woody">
      <div class="fam-num">03</div>
      <h3>Oud &amp; Woody</h3>
      <p>The statement scent. Oud, leather and sandalwood are the backbone of Gulf perfumery, prized for depth, prestige and the kind of staying power that lasts from morning meetings to a late dinner.</p>
      <div class="fam-bestfor"><span class="bl">Best For</span><div class="fam-tags"><span>Formal Wear</span><span>Signature Scent</span><span>All-Day Wear</span></div></div>
      <span class="fam-link">Explore Oud &amp; Woody <span class="mi" aria-hidden="true">arrow_forward</span></span>
    </a>
    <a class="usp-card fam-card fade-up" href="/collections/sweet-gourmand">
      <div class="fam-num">04</div>
      <h3>Sweet &amp; Gourmand</h3>
      <p>The compliment magnet. Notes of tobacco, vanilla, honey and tonka add a warm, moreish edge that draws people in, ideal for date nights and cooler evenings when you want to be memorable.</p>
      <div class="fam-bestfor"><span class="bl">Best For</span><div class="fam-tags"><span>Date Nights</span><span>Cool Season</span><span>Standing Out</span></div></div>
      <span class="fam-link">Explore Sweet &amp; Gourmand <span class="mi" aria-hidden="true">arrow_forward</span></span>
    </a>
  </div>
</div></section>

