<!-- FAQ -->
<section class="faq"><div class="faq-inner">
  <div class="faq-head fade-up"><span class="label">Your Questions, Answered</span><h2 class="sec-title">Frequently Asked <em>Questions</em></h2></div>
  <div class="faq-list fade-up">
    <details class="faq-item"><summary class="faq-q">Which men's perfumes last the longest in the UAE heat?<span class="mi" aria-hidden="true">add</span></summary><div class="faq-a">Oud, amber and woody Eau de Parfums hold up best in the heat. Their heavier base notes resist the high temperatures that burn off lighter fragrances quickly, so the scent stays with you through the day. Look for Eau de Parfum or Extrait concentrations for the strongest performance, and check the longevity note on each product page.</div></details>
    <details class="faq-item"><summary class="faq-q">What is a good men's perfume for the office?<span class="mi" aria-hidden="true">add</span></summary><div class="faq-a">For the office, a fresh or citrus fragrance is the safer choice. It projects just enough to be noticed up close without filling a shared or air-conditioned space. Save the heavier oud and spice scents for evenings, when stronger projection works in your favour.</div></details>
    <details class="faq-item"><summary class="faq-q">What is the difference between EDT and EDP?<span class="mi" aria-hidden="true">add</span></summary><div class="faq-a">Eau de Toilette (EDT) has a lighter concentration of fragrance oil, so it feels fresher but fades faster, which suits daytime and hot weather. Eau de Parfum (EDP) is more concentrated, richer and longer-lasting, making it the better pick for evenings and cooler months. Most of our men's range is EDP for that reason.</div></details>
    <details class="faq-item"><summary class="faq-q">How do I find a signature scent that suits me?<span class="mi" aria-hidden="true">add</span></summary><div class="faq-a">Start with the occasion you buy for most, whether that is work, evenings out or formal events, then choose the family that fits it. Once a scent earns you a few compliments and feels like you, it becomes your signature. Our range spans fresh, spicy, oud and gourmand so you can settle on the profile that fits your routine.</div></details>
    <details class="faq-item"><summary class="faq-q">Which men's perfume is best for making an impression?<span class="mi" aria-hidden="true">add</span></summary><div class="faq-a">Oud and spicy oriental fragrances make the strongest impression because they carry further and last longer. If you want to be remembered, look to deep oud, amber and incense-led scents, or a warm gourmand for something more approachable but still distinctive.</div></details>
    <details class="faq-item"><summary class="faq-q">Are these men's perfumes genuine?<span class="mi" aria-hidden="true">add</span></summary><div class="faq-a">Yes. Every men's perfume at The Fragrance Secrets is sourced through trusted suppliers and checked for authenticity before it ships. You are buying genuine designer and Arabian fragrances, with no imitations.</div></details>
    <details class="faq-item"><summary class="faq-q">What is a good men's perfume to give as a gift?<span class="mi" aria-hidden="true">add</span></summary><div class="faq-a">A versatile oud or a crowd-pleasing fresh scent makes a reliable gift, since both suit a wide range of tastes. If you are unsure of his preference, a well-known Arabian oud or a designer fresh fragrance is a safe, premium choice. Our gift sets are packaged ready to give for birthdays, Eid and special occasions.</div></details>
    <details class="faq-item"><summary class="faq-q">Do you ship men's perfumes internationally?<span class="mi" aria-hidden="true">add</span></summary><div class="faq-a">Yes. The Fragrance Secrets ships across the UAE and also delivers to customers in the United States and Canada. Shipping options, delivery times and available services are shown during checkout based on your destination.</div></details>
  </div>
</div></section>

